{"id": "t044-003", "text": "giulia's recital sunday 4pm at st marys hall. she's playing the chopin piece she's been stressing abt for months. need to get there early for seats", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "giulia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recital", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sunday 4pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressing", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get there early for seats", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t044-005", "text": "esther in hospital since tues w/ her gallbladder, op went ok but shes stuck in till at least the wkend. her husband said the first night was rough, lots of pain and she couldnt keep anything down. she's bored out of her mind now which is a good sign i guess. pop in sat afternoon w/ grapes or smthng and maybe the crossword books", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "esther", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since tues", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gallbladder", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "op", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "till at least the wkend"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first night", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "bored out of her mind", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pop in", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "sat afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
