{"id": "t044-026", "text": "emeka's back op postponed again, now 'sometime in nov'. so fed up. he's been off work since aug and the pain meds make him foggy so he can't even read much. his boss has been decent about it tho. he said the worst bit is not being able to pick up his little one. should go round w/ a takeaway one evening next wk and watch the football w/ him", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "emeka", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back op", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in nov", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fed up", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "off work", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since aug"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "pain meds make him foggy", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "little one", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "go round w/ a takeaway", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "one evening next wk", "anchor": "a1"}]}
