{"id": "t044-040", "text": "pieter's daughter Kiri has her first ballet show sat evening. he's dropping her at 5 then heading to the pub w/ his brother til its on. she's been doing the dance round the kitchen all wk apparently. his wife thinks she'll freeze on stage but kiri says she's not scared at all. maybe get her a little bunch of flowers for afterwards, the shop by the station does small ones", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "pieter", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiri", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first ballet show", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sat evening", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "5"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "til its on", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "kiri", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not scared", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get her a little bunch of flowers", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "a1"}]}
