{"id": "t044-046", "text": "nadia had a rough time at her appt. they want more tests next wk, bloods on tues and a biopsy thurs at 11. she was really shaken, kept saying she knew something was off. her partner tunde can't get time off for the thurs one so she's going alone. don't forget to text her tmrw morning and maybe offer to go w/ her thurs", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "nadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "appt", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "more tests", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next wk", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bloods", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tues", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "biopsy", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "thurs at 11", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "shaken", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "tunde", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "thurs", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "tmrw morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to go w/ her", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "thurs", "anchor": "a2"}]}
