{"id": "t044-057", "text": "isabel's audition for the conservatoire is in jan, she's applying to 3 - rncm, rcm and glasgow. her teacher Mrs Hughes thinks she's got a real shot. she's practising 5 hrs a day which sounds a lot, her wrists are already aching. the rncm one is 12 jan at 2pm and the others the wk after. she's dead set on manchester. send her that article on musicians' injuries", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "isabel", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "audition for the conservatoire", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in jan", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "teacher", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Hughes", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "practising 5 hrs a day", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wrists are already aching", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "rncm one", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "12 jan at 2pm", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the wk after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "dead set on manchester", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her that article on musicians' injuries", "action_type": "send", "timing": "unspecified", "owner": "p1"}]}
